<title>USA: TABLE - Life USA Q2 net oper income flat.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Life USA Q2 net oper income flat.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Life USA Holding Inc</p>
<p>		(Dollars in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					   Three months ended June 30,</p>
<p>								     % Change</p>
<p>					 1997	  1996  1996 to 1997</p>
<p>Revenues:</p>
<p>  TOTAL REVENUES			  91,816	77,429     19</p>
<p>Expenses:</p>
<p>  TOTAL EXPENSES			  83,068	68,479     21</p>
<p> Income before income taxes	    8,748	 8,950    (2)</p>
