<p>Number of shares used in earnings</p>
<p>   per share calculation	  24,613,383  23,373,323</p>
<p>NOTE: '97 Q2 net income includes $700,000 after-tax charge to meet a tax liability from prior years' activity.</p>
<p>'97 Q2 net operating income was $6.1 million, or $0.26 a share, versus $5.8 million, or $0.26 a share, in the second quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>'97 Q2 shares increased 1.2 million compared to the same period last year.</p>
